[bander@wam.umd.edu (Nicholas Andrew Vargish) writes:]
[] I'm getting really frustrated with NH 3.0 pl 9, on the PC.  But I would
[] like to see more of the game, so I'm going to try "Discover" mode.  Could
[] someone send me a list of the extended commands, please?

explore-mode (discover-mode) is essentially the same as a normal game but
you start with a wand of wishing, dying is optional and you can see your
intrinsics with the <ctrl>-x command.

wizard-mode (debug-mode) commands are given under the help, "?", when
you play in that mode.  i'm not certain but it seems not all wizard
passwords are documented on various personal computer ports.  the
wizard name, strangely enough, is "wizard" as of pl8.  typically this
is used as in "nethack -u wizard -D".

**** WARNING ****
abusing debug-mode can quickly and irrevocably spoil/ruin your game!
you must follow your conscience in these matters ...

in either explore-mode or wizard-mode your progress does not get recorded
to the scoreboard.

